Amnesia	CLASSES:Bard=4|Medium=3|Mesmerist=4|Psychic=4|Sorcerer=4|Wizard=4	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Mind-Affecting	TIME:1 round	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)	TARGETAREA:One living creature	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:You cause the target to lose most of its memories; its skills, its past, and even its name become mysteries to it.	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Appearance of Life (Greater)	CLASSES:Cleric=5|Medium=4|Mesmerist=5|Psychic=5|Sorcerer=5|Spiritualist=4|Witch=5|Wizard=5	SCHOOL:Illusion	SUBSCHOOL:Glamer	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One willing undead creature touched	DURATION:1 hour/level	DESC:Functions as appearance of life, except you can disguise a single undead creature regardless of its Hit Dice, including relevant smells, sounds, textures, and temperatures.	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Covetous Urge	CLASSES:Bard=2|Sorcerer=2|Summoner=2|Witch=2|Wizard=2	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Curse|Language-Dependent|Mind-Affecting	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, M (a golden coin)	RANGE:Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)	TARGETAREA:One living creature with 7 HD or fewer	DURATION:1 minute/level (D)	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:You curse the target with insatiable greed, causing it to attempt to steal any item worth 100 gp or more that it can see.	SOURCEPAGE:p.8
Hide Bruises	CLASSES:Antipaladin=1|Bard=1|Inquisitor=1|Occultist=1|Psychic=1|Sorcerer=1|Witch=1|Wizard=1	SCHOOL:Illusion	SUBSCHOOL:Glamer	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, M (drop of blood)	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One creature touched	DURATION:10 minutes/level (D)	SAVEINFO:Will disbelief (see text)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	DESC:The target's wounds seem to disappear, adding a penalty to Heal checks to determine injury severity.	SOURCEPAGE:p.20
Resist Starvation	CLASSES:Antipaladin=1|Cleric=1|Shaman=1	SCHOOL:Transmutation	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, M (crumb of food)	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One living creature touched	DURATION:1 day/level	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	DESC:If the target does not eat on the day this is cast, the DC to avoid starvation damage on the following day does not increase.	SOURCEPAGE:p.21
Beacon of Guilt	CLASSES:Bard=2|Inquisitor=2|Occultist=2|Sorcerer=2|Wizard=2	SCHOOL:Evocation	DESCRIPTOR:Curse	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One object	DURATION:24 hours or until discharged, then instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates (object)	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:Places an invisible ward on an object; the next creature to move it becomes cursed and surrounded by faerie fire.	SOURCEPAGE:p.44
Escape Alarm	CLASSES:Bard=2|Inquisitor=2|Occultist=2|Psychic=2|Ranger=2|Sorcerer=2|Spiritualist=2|Summoner=2|Wizard=2	SCHOOL:Abjuration	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, F (a short segment of a chain)	RANGE:Medium (100 ft. + 10 ft./level)	TARGETAREA:Ten 10-foot cubes/level	DURATION:24 hours	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	DESC:Functions as alarm, except it notifies you when a creature exits the area rather than enters it.	SOURCEPAGE:p.45
Outbreak	CLASSES:Antipaladin=2|Bloodrager=3|Cleric=2|Druid=2|Sorcerer=3|Wizard=3	SCHOOL:Necromancy	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)	TARGETAREA:20-ft. burst	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude partial	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:Diseased creatures in the area are overcome by coughing, becoming fatigued and exposing adjacent creatures to their diseases.	SOURCEPAGE:p.68
Virulent Miasma	CLASSES:Antipaladin=2|Bloodrager=3|Druid=3|Sorcerer=3|Wizard=3	SCHOOL:Necromancy	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, M (dried scab)	RANGE:Medium (100 ft. + 10 ft./level)	TARGETAREA:Cloud spreads in 20-ft. radius, 20 ft. high	DURATION:1 round/level	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates (see text)	SPELLRES:See text	DESC:Creates a fog cloud tainted with disease, conferring a penalty on saving throws against disease effects for those inside.	SOURCEPAGE:p.68
Cloak of Shadows	CLASSES:Antipaladin=4|Bard=5|Mesmerist=5|Sorcerer=5|Spiritualist=5|Wizard=5	SCHOOL:Illusion	SUBSCHOOL:Shadow	DESCRIPTOR:Evil|Shadow	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:1 minute/level	DESC:Wraps you in a protective mantle of semi-real shadow, granting concealment, Stealth bonuses, DR 5/good, and protection from direct sunlight.	SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Shadow Claws	CLASSES:Antipaladin=1|Bard=2|Bloodrager=2|Magus=2|Sorcerer=2|Spiritualist=2|Wizard=2	SCHOOL:Illusion	SUBSCHOOL:Shadow	DESCRIPTOR:Shadow	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:1 minute/level	DESC:Summons semi-real claws over your hands granting primary claw attacks that deal Strength damage.	SOURCEPAGE:p.81
Shadow Jaunt	CLASSES:Antipaladin=3|Bard=4|Sorcerer=4|Spiritualist=4|Summoner=4|Wizard=4	SCHOOL:Illusion	SUBSCHOOL:Shadow	DESCRIPTOR:Shadow	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S	RANGE:Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:Instantaneous and 1 round (see text)	DESC:Instantly travel between shadows to a point within range, leaving a shadowy image behind while gaining temporary concealment.	SOURCEPAGE:p.81
Fool's Gold	CLASSES:Bard=1|Medium=1|Mesmerist=1|Psychic=1|Sorcerer=1|Wizard=1	SCHOOL:Illusion	TIME:1 standard action	COMPONENTS:V, S, M (copper or silver piece)	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Objects touched	DURATION:1 hour/level	SAVEINFO:None or Will disbelief (see text)	SPELLRES:No	DESC:Temporarily makes copper or silver seem to be an equivalent amount of gold.	SOURCEPAGE:p.117